-- Innkeepers: 63 gossip options on 45 innkeeper menus had OptionType 0 / OptionNpcflag 0 (or the wrong type), so the
-- server hid them (Player::PrepareGossipMenu skips options whose OptionNpcflag does not match the creature) or they did
-- the wrong thing (3 "browse your goods" options bound the hearthstone). 36 innkeepers (e.g. Keldamyr 6736 in Dolanaar,
-- Farley 295 in Goldshire) offered no options. Set the standard types: bind = 8/65536 (INNKEEPER), shop = 3/128
-- (VENDOR), "What can I do at an inn?" = 1/1 (GOSSIP). Innkeepers without a menu use the default menu 0 and were fine.
